id: pm-0fxa
title: "PR review helper: watch GitHub checks and enforce thread-scoped replies"
description: "Make the review-loop script use GitHub check completion as the reviewer wait signal, take a complete exact-head inventory afterward, and prevent misleading generic PR comments where GitHub has no reply thread."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: developer-experience,github,review-automation
