parent: pm-hq28
risk: medium
confidence: high
release: v2026.7.14
resolution: Added check-watching exact-head inventory and real inline acknowledgement commands to the PR review helper.
expected_result: One GitHub check watch replaces timed waits and all explanations land in actual inline threads without missing non-threadable bot surfaces.
actual_result: "The helper watched PR #546 to completion in one call, returned all 18 comments, 17 reviews, and 13 threads on the exact head, and passed exact full coverage plus strict quality gates."
